3
00:00:06,800 --> 00:00:09,767
The calendar lists earnings Wednesday after the close.

4
00:00:09,957 --> 00:00:15,837
At the October 23 close, Carvana was at $57.81.

5
00:00:15,837 --> 00:00:20,997
The weekly low at $56.28 is a support reference.

6
00:00:20,997 --> 00:00:24,917
Resistance is near $62.07.

7
00:00:24,917 --> 00:00:28,117
Price is below all four moving averages.

8
00:00:28,117 --> 00:00:30,590
Reclaiming the fifty day line would require

9
00:00:30,590 --> 00:00:32,225
more than a small bounce.

10
00:00:32,415 --> 00:00:33,298
RSI is 37.5.

11
00:00:33,298 --> 00:00:37,053
Friday recovered from its low and closed

12
00:00:37,053 --> 00:00:41,014
