16
00:00:49,623 --> 00:00:54,966
Zacks projects quarterly revenue of about $7.67B,

17
00:00:54,966 --> 00:00:57,103
up roughly thirty six percent.

18
00:00:57,103 --> 00:01:00,080
Its estimates also show lower total gross

19
00:01:00,080 --> 00:01:03,143
