20
00:01:03,143 --> 00:01:05,453
More cars sold can support growth, while

21
00:01:05,453 --> 00:01:08,323
weaker profit per vehicle pressures the quality

22
00:01:08,323 --> 00:01:09,350
of that growth.

23
00:01:09,540 --> 00:01:13,820
The earnings estimate is $0.47 per share.

24
00:01:13,820 --> 00:01:17,567
The October 30 at-the-money straddle midpoint gives

25
00:01:17,567 --> 00:01:20,960
a rough 13.6 percent move in either direction.

26
00:01:20,960 --> 00:01:23,920
It covers risk through expiry, not just

27
00:01:23,920 --> 00:01:26,767
earnings, and the actual move can be larger.

28
00:01:26,957 --> 00:01:34,317
Holding $56.28 and reclaiming $62.07 would improve the chart.

29
00:01:34,317 --> 00:01:36,837
A break below support would weaken it.

30
00:01:36,837 --> 00:01:40,037
Watch the reaction and volume after the report.

31
